@startuml Activity Diagram - Create Exercise Transaction
title Activity Diagram: Create Exercise Transaction

|#LightBlue|Teacher|
start
:Teacher navigates to Create Exercise page;
:Select exercise type (Multiple Choice/Execution);

if (Exercise Type?) then (Multiple Choice)
  :Enter exercise title;
  :Enter question text;
  :Add answer options;
  :Mark correct answer;
  :Set difficulty level;
else (Execution)
  :Enter exercise title;
  :Enter instruction text;
  :Upload demonstration video;
  :Set expected gesture/sign;
  :Set difficulty level;
endif

:Review exercise details;

if (Validation passed?) then (No)
  :Display validation errors;
  :Highlight required fields;
  stop
else (Yes)
endif

:Submit exercise creation request;

|#LightGreen|Frontend|
:Validate form data;
:Show loading state;
:Send POST request to /api/exercises;

|#LightCoral|Backend API|
:Receive create exercise request;
:Validate request data;
:Authenticate teacher;

if (Authentication valid?) then (No)
  :Return 401 Unauthorized;
  |#LightGreen|Frontend|
  :Display auth error;
  stop
else (Yes)
endif

if (Data validation passed?) then (No)
  :Return 400 Bad Request;
  |#LightGreen|Frontend|
  :Display validation errors;
  stop
else (Yes)
endif

:Process file uploads (if any);

if (File upload successful?) then (No)
  :Return 500 Server Error;
  |#LightGreen|Frontend|
  :Display upload error;
  stop
else (Yes)
endif

|#LightYellow|Database|
:Begin transaction;
:Insert exercise record;
:Insert exercise options (if Multiple Choice);
:Insert exercise media (if any);

if (Database operation successful?) then (No)
  :Rollback transaction;
  |#LightCoral|Backend API|
  :Return 500 Server Error;
  |#LightGreen|Frontend|
  :Display creation error;
  stop
else (Yes)
endif

:Commit transaction;
:Return exercise ID and details;

|#LightCoral|Backend API|
:Log successful creation;
:Return 201 Created with exercise data;

|#LightGreen|Frontend|
:Hide loading state;
:Display success message;
:Navigate to exercise list or details;

|#LightBlue|Teacher|
:View newly created exercise;
:Exercise available for assignment;

stop

@enduml